At ING, we're building the solutions of tomorrow, today | 80% of our colleagues in Romania agree
For the tribe PSS, we are looking for a Business Analyst to join the team of our SWIFT/IRM/GFME Financial Messaging Platform.
SWIFT, IRM and GFME applications need to comply with many yearly mandatory/ regulatory questionnaires like the SWIFT Customer Security Program, but also questionnaires such as MAS or CHAPS amongst others.
The Business Analyst has responsibility for all activities related to questions / queries ING receives in the context of attestations (incl. Customer Security Programme), questionnaires from internal ING entities (e.g. for audits), and questionnaires from local regulators. The Business Analyst works most of its time in a squad within ING’s Agile organization, together with other experts to achieve the squad’s mission specifically on collecting, centralizing and organizing all needed evidences for the above mentioned questionnaires . The Business Analyst has expertise in the areas of product management (SWIFT, MT and MX messaging, ISO20022) and process optimisation.
